# The Standards Applied: Teaching Data Visualization.

**Authors:** van Reeuwijk, Martin

## Abstract
Reports part of the results of the Design, Development, and Assessment in Mathematics Education Project that tested the booklet on descriptive statistics called &quot;Data Visualization&quot; in six experimental algebra classes in Whitnall, Wisconsin. Describes examples of problems presented, use of cooperative learning during instruction, and reactions of the students and teachers to the learning and teaching employed. (MDH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ455048

